1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,683
Let's open your n8n workspace.

2
00:00:02,683 --> 00:00:03,844
It takes about two minutes.

3
00:00:03,844 --> 00:00:06,816
You need a laptop, and an e-mail
inbox you can open right now.

4
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:11,363
Go to n8n dot i o, slash pricing,
and click Start free trial.

5
00:00:11,363 --> 00:00:14,312
This is n8n Cloud, and no
credit card is required.

6
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:19,572
Register with your e-mail address and a
password, then open the verification e-mail.

7
00:00:19,572 --> 00:00:22,451
If it is not there, check
spam and the Promotions tab.

8
00:00:22,451 --> 00:00:24,099
Still nothing after two minutes?

9
00:00:24,099 --> 00:00:27,571
Raise your hand in Zoom, and the co-host
will help you in a breakout room.

10
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:31,022
Your workspace gets its
own name and address.

11
00:00:31,022 --> 00:00:33,437
The dashboard shows how
many trial days are left.

12
00:00:33,437 --> 00:00:34,784
Click Open instance.

13
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:38,360
After about a minute you
see: your instance is ready.

14
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,811
Click Start automating.

15
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:44,851
n8n asks two short questions;
answer them or skip.

16
00:00:44,851 --> 00:00:49,901
Notice the counter at the top left: fourteen
days left, and zero of one thousand executions.

17
00:00:49,901 --> 00:00:51,863
Every test run counts as one.

18
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,604
You are in.

19
00:00:53,604 --> 00:00:56,785
From here, Build a workflow
opens an empty canvas.

20
00:00:56,785 --> 00:00:59,084
Stop at this page and wait for the group.

21
00:01:00,210 --> 00:01:02,869
One habit for the whole course.

22
00:01:02,869 --> 00:01:08,360
At the end of every session, open the three-dots
menu next to the workflow name, and choose

23
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:09,347
Export JSON.

24
00:01:09,347 --> 00:01:14,142
Import, From file, loads it
back into any n8n workspace.

25
00:01:15,290 --> 00:01:16,509
Three rules for the trial.

26
00:01:16,509 --> 00:01:19,539
It lasts fourteen days, and
then the workspace is deleted.

27
00:01:19,539 --> 00:01:21,629
It allows one thousand executions.

28
00:01:21,629 --> 00:01:24,764
And you export your workflows
at the end of every session.

